# What "Pax for iPhone set-up" on Windows bundles, installed with --no-deps (same idea as
# device/requirements-bundle.in on the Mac): the import closure of device/pax_device.py,
# traced for Windows. Differences from the Mac list:
#   - no ioregistry (macOS only)
#   - pywin32: pymobiledevice3.osu.win_util imports win32security on Windows; Pax also
#     uses win32crypt (DPAPI) to keep the account token on this PC only
#   - colorama: click and tqdm use it on Windows
# Regenerate the hashes after changing a version:
#   python windows/lock_windows.py          (writes windows/requirements-windows.txt)
